Chicago World Language Academy’s MISSION is to create collaborative and culturally responsive learning environments  through exemplary academic, social-emotional, and world language instruction for ALL of our students.

A CWLA Graduate:
- values, connects, and collaborates with people from diverse backgrounds;
- is a confident and inquisitive reader, writer, and problem-solver;
- is a proficient language and culture learner;
- and is a kind, resepctful and reflective community member

NTA is a uniquely designed neighborhood school that brings teachers, students, and parents together with educators, universities, and the community. NTA provides a curriculum responsive to students&rsquo; interests, backgrounds, and individual educational needs. NTA staff members collaborate with students and families to create an engaging, authentic, and caring environment.
